endobj
627 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Four polar area charts titled 2024, 2023, 2022, and 2021 compare data distributions in categories labeled by ranges and percentages. Categories like \(0.5, 0.6\) and \(0.8, 0.9\) dominate in each year's chart, with varying prominence. Red shades highlight differences across years.) /K 659 0 R /P 219 0 R /Pg 211 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
628 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Two scatter plots compare data clusters. Each plot contains green, red, and blue data points with larger markers indicating cluster centroids. Both plots exhibit distinct clustering patterns, with variations in data point distribution.) /K 660 0 R /P 219 0 R /Pg 212 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
